---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base
  title="Design Org AI Initiatives | Jeremy Hoover"
  description="How an agent I initiated was adopted and used by 150+ designers, alongside the knowledge and AI education initiatives I drove across the Microsoft design org."
>
  <article class="section case-study case-study--orange">
    <div class="container container--narrow">

      <a href={`${base}/#projects`} class="back">← Back</a>

      <span class="tag">Org-level · Design Org · Organization-wide adoption</span>
      <h1>Building AI infrastructure across the design org</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I didn't wait for AI initiatives to find me. An agent I initiated was adopted and used by
        150+ designers. I also drove the org knowledge initiative and became someone designers and
        leaders rely on for AI education and senior leadership demonstrations.
      </p>

      <div class="outcomes-strip">
        <div class="outcome"><span class="outcome__num">150+</span><span class="outcome__label">designers adopted and used an agent I initiated</span></div>
        <div class="outcome"><span class="outcome__num">Champs</span><span class="outcome__label">early contributor and relied-upon educator</span></div>
        <div class="outcome"><span class="outcome__num">Leadership</span><span class="outcome__label">demos built by me for leadership visits</span></div>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <h2>Agent adoption across the design org</h2>
      <p>
        I initiated and led the foundational work for a content design writing agent that was
        adopted and used by 150+ designers across Microsoft's design org. I created the foundational
        files, then as the initiative grew, contributed to refinements and the business-area-specific
        implementation alongside other content designers.
      </p>
      <p>
        I didn't join something that existed. I built the thing others joined.
      </p>

      <h2>Knowledge initiative</h2>
      <p>
        I drove the initiative to collect and maintain design knowledge across the org: a structured
        approach to capturing what the team knows so it doesn't get lost when people move on or
        context disappears. It's now a key initiative within the group.
      </p>

      <h2>Champs group</h2>
      <p>
        I'm an early contributor to the AI Champs group, the community of practitioners pushing AI
        adoption forward across the design org. I'm relied on to teach, to demonstrate, and to create
        the demos that go in front of senior leadership. When SL comes to town and needs to see what
        the team is doing with AI, I build those demos.
      </p>
      <p>
        This kind of trust takes time to build and doesn't show up in a job title. It's built through
        consistently being the person who figured it out first and then helped everyone else do the same.
      </p>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="nav-row">
        <a href={`${base}/work/hackathon`} class="btn btn--outline">Previous: Hackathon win</a>
        <a href={`${base}/work/fabric-cli`} class="btn">Next: Fabric CLI skills</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .case-study { padding-top: 3rem; }
  .back { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .back:hover { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
  .tag { margin-bottom: 1rem; display: inline-block; }
  h1 { margin-block: 1rem 1.5rem; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 3rem; max-width: 58ch; line-height: 1.6; }
  .outcomes-strip { display: flex; gap: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-block: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .outcome { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; }
  .outcome__num { font-family: var(--f-heading); font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); line-height: 1; }
  .outcome__label { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: none; }
  h2 { margin-top: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  p { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--text); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.15s; }
  .btn:hover { background: #333; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
  .btn--outline { background: transparent; color: var(--text); border: 1.5px solid var(--text); }
  .btn--outline:hover { background: var(--text); color: #fff; }
  .nav-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; }
  .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-block: 3rem; }
</style>

